{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The current phase permits a proposal and model code, but no training. The existing runs show a useful tradeoff: uniform compression has the best click AUC, while feedback grouping improves auxiliary AUCs but lowers click AUC. I’ll test whether each task can use a different compressed history through a shared scorer, with four routing controls to isolate that choice."}}
